      "asset": "tue",
      "voice": null,
      "step": "",
      "emotion": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "大家好,我是陈果!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "我是多多!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "一晃就周二了,太空实验室开工。今天问你一个事:宇航员在舱外,冲同伴大喊一声,他听得见吗?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "宇航员飘在太空舱外,做舱外维修。同伴在舱内,对着他大喊一声。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "然后呢?他听见了吗?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "声音,一点没传出去。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "哪怕贴着舱壁喊,外面的宇航员也听不见。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "两个人明明离得很近,却像隔着一堵永远打不穿的墙。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "这堵墙,不是舱壁做的。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "声音,到底去哪儿了?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "text": "",
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": null,
      "step": "",
      "emotion": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "在家里,你喊一嗓子。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "声音靠空气一路传过去,撞进耳朵里,你才能听见。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "空气就像一串多米诺骨牌,一个撞一个,把声音传下去。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "那太空舱外呢?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "太空舱外,没有空气。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "没有多米诺骨牌,声音刚喊出口,就没有下一张牌可以撞了。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "喊得再大声也没用?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "对,声音根本走不出你的嘴。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "哇,那不就等于隔着一层真空在打哑语!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "所以宇航员在舱外维修,靠的不是喊,是无线电。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "无线电信号不需要空气,能一路传到耳机里。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "这时候,喊话没用,说话才管用。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "flip",
      "text": "你以为怪的是听不见。其实怪的是——不是喊得不够大声,是根本没有路能让声音走。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "retell",
      "text": "太空舱外没有空气,声音传不出去。宇航员在舱外只能靠无线电说话,不能大喊大叫。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "好啦,今天就聊到这儿。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "下次玩太空题材的游戏,可以留意这个细节!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "preview",
      "text": "明天,我们算一算。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "preview",
      "text": "开车去月球,要开多久?我们明天见!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    }
  ],
  "waived_rules": []
}